 and SEO specialists to ensure that a website is built with search engine optimization in mind from the ground up.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/technical-seo\/#faq-question-1709099946481","position":5,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/technical-seo\/#faq-question-1709099946481","name":"5. How to do a technical SEO audit?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"To perform a technical SEO audit, you should:<br\/><br\/>Analyze the website's crawlability and indexation status using tools like Google Search Console.<br\/>Check the site's mobile-friendliness and loading speed with tools like Google's Mobile-Friendly Test and PageSpeed Insights.<br\/>Review security aspects, ensuring the site uses HTTPS.<br\/>Inspect on-site SEO factors like structured data, XML sitemaps, and robots.txt files.<br\/>Identify and resolve any duplicate content or canonicalization issues.<br\/>Evaluate the website's architecture for user and search engine friendliness.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/technical-seo\/#faq-question-1709099964918","position":6,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/technical-seo\/#faq-question-1709099964918","name":"6. What are the benefits of technical SEO?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The benefits of technical SEO include improved website speed, better user experience, increased crawlability and indexation by search engines, enhanced security, and ultimately, higher rankings in search engine results pages (SERPs). This leads to more visibility, traffic, and potentially conversions.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/technical-seo\/#faq-question-1709099984998","position":7,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/technical-seo\/#faq-question-1709099984998","name":"7. What is a technical SEO checklist?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A technical SEO checklist is a comprehensive list of items to check and optimize on a website to improve its search engine rankings. It typically includes ensuring site speed optimization, mobile-friendliness, secure connections (HTTPS), proper use of robots.txt, creating and submitting XML sitemaps, implementing structured data, and fixing crawl errors.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/technical-seo\/#faq-question-1709100002002","position":8,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/technical-seo\/#faq-question-1709100002002","name":"8. How to become a technical SEO manager?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"To become a technical SEO manager, you should:<br\/><br\/>Gain a solid understanding of SEO principles and technical aspects of website development.<br\/>Acquire experience in SEO through projects, internships, or work experience.<br\/>Stay updated with the latest SEO trends, tools, and algorithm changes.<br\/>Develop strong analytical and problem-solving skills.<br\/>Consider certifications or courses in SEO and related fields to enhance your knowledge and credibility.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/technical-seo\/#faq-question-1709100017573","position":9,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/technical-seo\/#faq-question-1709100017573","name":"9. What are technical SEO issues?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Technical SEO issues can include problems like slow site speed, poor mobile responsiveness, issues with site security (not using HTTPS), crawl errors, duplicate content, incorrect use of robots.txt or canonical tags, and missing XML sitemaps. These issues can negatively impact a site's search engine rankings.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/technical-seo\/#faq-question-1709100035291","position":10,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/technical-seo\/#faq-question-1709100035291","name":"10. What is an SEO tech developer?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"An SEO tech developer is a specialist who combines knowledge of SEO with technical skills in web development. They focus on optimizing websites for search engines from a technical standpoint, ensuring the site is built and structured in a way that maximizes its visibility and ranking in search engine results. They work on aspects such as site speed optimization, mobile responsiveness, structured data implementation, and more.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"}]}},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7225","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/3"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=7225"}],"version-history":[{"count":30,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7225\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":22856,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7225\/revisions\/22856"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/7312"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=7225"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=7225"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?p